<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Ace Fuel Loyalty &middot; Last updated: 13 July 2026</p>

    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>Ace Fuel Loyalty</strong> (the &ldquo;App&rdquo;),
    operated by <strong>thoughtbasics</strong> (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;), collects, uses,
    and protects information in connection with our fuel-station loyalty program. The App is used by
    fuel-station staff to manage customer loyalty accounts, points, and transactions.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Staff account information</strong> — the login identifier and authentication tokens
        used to sign staff members in to the App.</li>
      <li><strong>Customer information</strong> — name, email address, phone number, loyalty membership
        identifier, and vehicle / number-plate details that staff view or enter to service a customer's
        loyalty account.</li>
      <li><strong>Loyalty and transaction data</strong> — points balances, points adjustments,
        redemptions, and fuel-transaction records associated with a loyalty account.</li>
      <li><strong>Device information</strong> — a push-notification token (via Firebase Cloud Messaging)
        so we can deliver operational notifications to the device.</li>
      <li><strong>Camera</strong> — the App uses the camera solely to scan vehicle number plates. Plate
        images are processed <strong>on the device</strong> to read the plate text and are
        <strong>not stored or uploaded</strong> by the App.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Authenticate staff and secure access to the App.</li>
      <li>Look up loyalty accounts and process points, redemptions, and transactions.</li>
      <li>Send operational and schedule-related push notifications.</li>
      <li>Provide support, prevent fraud and abuse, and keep the service secure and reliable.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do <strong>not</strong> use your information for advertising, and we do not sell personal
    information.</p>

    <h2>How information is shared</h2>
    <p>We share information only with service providers who process it on our behalf to run the service:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google Firebase Cloud Messaging</strong> — to deliver push notifications.</li>
      <li><strong>Google Cloud Platform</strong> — hosting and data storage.</li>
      <li><strong>Number-plate recognition provider</strong> — where server-side plate recognition is used
        to speed up customer lookup, plate data may be processed by a third-party recognition service.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We may also disclose information where required by law or to protect our legal rights.</p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>We retain loyalty and transaction records for as long as the loyalty account is active and as
    needed to provide the service and meet legal, accounting, or reporting obligations, after which the
    data is deleted or anonymised.</p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>All data transmitted between the App and our servers is encrypted in transit using HTTPS/TLS.
    Access to loyalty data is restricted to authenticated staff and administrators.</p>

    <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
    <p>To request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information, contact us at the address
    below. Loyalty-account data can be removed on request, subject to any legal retention requirements.</p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>The App is a business tool intended for fuel-station staff and adult customers. It is not directed
    to children, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by updating
    the &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date above.</p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>Questions or requests regarding this policy or your data:
      <br><strong>thoughtbasics</strong>
      <br>Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@thoughtbasics.com">privacy@thoughtbasics.com</a></p>

    <footer>&copy; 2026 thoughtbasics. All rights reserved.</footer>
  </main>
